{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01RiJHr3bSMMRWZEw3khUy9m","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01FJvJysBZfiHouebMGWQVbD","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/workspace/KEY_DECISIONS.md","content":"# KEY DECISIONS — SOS card implementation\n\nLightweight log of ambiguities, deviations from TODO.md, and deliberate\ncard-local limitations.\n\n## E1 — Fire SpellCastTriggeredEvent\n- Fired in `cast_spell` after the StackObject is pushed. Populated all four\n  fields (`spell`=StackObject, `card`, `player`, `controller`) so both the\n  `event.player`/`event.controller` and `event.spell`/`event.card` access\n  patterns used by FDN cards work. Copies (`copy_spell`) do not re-fire (they\n  never go through `cast_spell`) — correct per rules.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":468,"cache_read_input_tokens":129930,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":468},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"592332b8-98ed-42d2-9d22-0e80177d6858","uuid":"101778bb-4c99-4000-8cea-1d3d173bcdc6","request_id":"req_011CbtKnyivGy5vjHQUaPGLT"}
