{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01BpZTU3AXUTEiAgyUiyvuSa","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_019VSAyxdyFsuATS9us7QGyw","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cat >> /workspace/KEY_DECISIONS.md <<'EOF'\n\n## sos_257 — Great Hall of the Biblioplex\n- Restricted mana (gap): added `_restricted` tracking + `add(...,restricted=)`,\n  `has_restricted/reserve_restricted/restore_restricted` to ManaPool, and a\n  reserve/restore around the mana payment in `cast_spell` for non-instant/\n  sorcery spells. Default behaviour unchanged. Limitation: spending restricted\n  mana on an instant doesn't decrement the marker, and the marker isn't honored\n  for activated-ability costs — both safe because pools empty each phase.\n- Animation: mutated the Land instance in place (add CREATURE type + Wizard +\n  2/4, register pump trigger), updated `_original_card_types` so the cleanup\n  reset keeps the creature type. Power/toughness are properties; the until-EOT\n  pump is an instance `_pt_pump` reset by the overridden `_reset_characteristics`\n  (invoked by `effect_manager.apply_all` during cleanup). No new permanent.\nEOF\nsed -i 's/- \\[ \\] \\*\\*sos_257 — Great Hall of the Biblioplex\\*\\*/- [x] **sos_257 — Great Hall of the Biblioplex**/' TODO.md\npython3 -m pytest engine_tests/ -q 2>&1 | tail -1 && git add -A && git commit -q -m \"sos_257: Great Hall of the Biblioplex\" && echo committed","description":"Commit sos_257"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":131,"cache_creation_input_tokens":579,"cache_read_input_tokens":213803,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":579},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"592332b8-98ed-42d2-9d22-0e80177d6858","uuid":"4f7d2be8-d02f-44c8-88b1-13